        <rdfs:label>PCB Assembly</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A process where electronic components are mounted and soldered onto printed circuit boards using methods such as surface-mount, through-hole, or mixed assembly.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


